          <p>
            One detail that surprises new owners: published decibel figures almost always refer to quarter load or eco mode. Load the same generator to 90% and it will run 6-10 dB louder because the engine throttles up. Our measurements in the reviews above are at a realistic mixed household load, not idle, which is why they read higher than the marketing numbers.
          </p>

